       </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <th style=\"color:#707070;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:2px 0\">\r\n                                            Created:\r\n                                        </th> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;padding:2px 0 2px 5px;vertical-align:top\">\r\n                                             03/Mar/15 10:42 PM \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <th style=\"color:#707070;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:2px 0\">\r\n                                            Priority:\r\n                                        </th> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;padding:2px 0 2px 5px;vertical-align:top\"> <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/sparkr-dev/attach/6b30d80a9d81002e/?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" border=\"0\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Major\" style=\"vertical-align:text-bottom\"> Major \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <th style=\"color:#707070;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:2px 0\">\r\n                                            Reporter:\r\n                                        </th> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;padding:2px 0 2px 5px;vertical-align:top\"> <a rel=\"shivaram nofollow\" href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=shivaram\" style=\"color:#3b73af;color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name%3Dshivaram&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240713958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2LKubBziAQR4gB_Q6MXY1g\">Shivaram Venkataraman</a> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border-left:1px solid #ccc;border-right:1px solid #ccc;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;padding:0 15px 0 16px;background-color:#fff;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:10px\"> \r\n                                <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px\"> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:0 0 10px 0\"> \r\n                                            <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin:10px 0 0 0\">We should develop a SparkR style guide document based on the some of the guidelines we use and some of the best practices in R.</p> \r\n                                            <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin:10px 0 0 0\">Some examples of R style guide are:</p> \r\n                                            <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin:10px 0 0 0\"><a href=\"http://r-pkgs.had.co.nz/r.html#style\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-pkgs.had.co.nz/r.html%23style&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240713958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1fA3QSAlDxsiIJ5iiqRQRV\">http://r-pkgs.had.co.nz/r.html#style</a> <br> <a href=\"http://google-styleguide.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/google-r-style.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://google-styleguide.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/google-r-style.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240713958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2f5uCpG2udBrNX86UDgSO8\">http://google-styleguide.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/google-r-style.html</a></p> \r\n                                            <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin:10px 0 0 0\">A related issue is to work on a automatic style checking tool. <a href=\"https://github.com/jimhester/lintr\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jimhester/lintr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240713958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2iYhh1k0m4zwmWfQW52yzv\">https://github.com/jimhester/lintr</a> seems promising</p> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border-left:1px solid #ccc;border-right:1px solid #ccc;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;padding:0 15px 0 16px;background-color:#fff\"> \r\n                                <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px\"> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:10px 0 10px 24px;vertical-align:middle;padding-left:0\"> \r\n                                            <table align=\"left\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"> \r\n                                                <tr> \r\n                                                    <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:middle\"> <a href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-216#add-comment\" title=\"Add Comment\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-216%23add-comment&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240713958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IcvxPJhKlmQ-enkcOK7gl\"> <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/sparkr-dev/attach/6b30d80a9d81002e/?part=0.3&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Add Comment\" title=\"Add Comment\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" border=\"0\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> </a> \r\n                                                    </td> \r\n                                                    <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;padding-left:5px\"> <a href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-216#add-comment\" title=\"Add Comment\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-216%23add-comment&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240713958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IcvxPJhKlmQ-enkcOK7gl\">Add Comment</a> \r\n                                                    </td> \r\n                                                </tr> \r\n                                            </table> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n              